---
// Service cards: 4 columns on desktop, 2 on tablet, a peeking carousel on phones (Interiors hidden on phones).
---

<section id="responsive-layout-settings" class="section rls">
  <!-- kit: responsive-layout-settings -->
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p class="lead">Four services, one team from first sketch to handover.</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="rls__grid">
      <li class="rls__item" style="--mobile-order: 1">
        <a class="rls__card" href="/services/residential">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/lumen-residential/1600/1000" alt="A living room lit by a tall slit window" width="3200" height="2000" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="rls__body">
            <h3>Residential</h3>
            <p>Houses and apartment renovations shaped around light and air.</p>
            <span class="rls__more">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="rls__item" style="--mobile-order: 2">
        <a class="rls__card" href="/services/civic">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/lumen-library/1600/1000" alt="A library reading room under a sawtooth roof" width="3200" height="2000" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="rls__body">
            <h3>Civic &amp; cultural</h3>
            <p>Libraries, schools and small museums for municipalities.</p>
            <span class="rls__more">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="rls__item rls__item--hide-mobile">
        <a class="rls__card" href="/services/interiors">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/lumen-joinery/1600/1000" alt="Oak joinery with integrated lighting" width="3200" height="2000" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="rls__body">
            <h3>Interiors</h3>
            <p>Joinery, lighting and material palettes, specified to the millimetre.</p>
            <span class="rls__more">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="rls__item" style="--mobile-order: 3">
        <a class="rls__card" href="/services/daylight">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/lumen-daylight/1600/1000" alt="A sun-path diagram over a site plan" width="3200" height="2000" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="rls__body">
            <h3>Daylight studies</h3>
            <p>Sun-path and glare modelling for other architects' projects.</p>
            <span class="rls__more">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Desktop: 4 columns, large gap, xl vertical padding */
  .rls {
    padding-block: clamp(80px, 10vw, 128px);
  }
  .rls__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .rls__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--bg);
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease;
  }
  .rls__card:hover {
    border-color: var(--ink-3);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .rls__card img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .rls__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }
  .rls__body p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .rls__more {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--brand);
  }

  /* Tablet: own layout, 2 columns, medium gap, large padding */
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .rls {
      padding-block: clamp(64px, 9vw, 96px);
    }
    .rls__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  /* Mobile: carousel with a peek of the next card, medium padding, custom order */
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .rls {
      padding-block: 56px;
    }
    .rls__grid {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }
    .rls__item {
      flex: 0 0 82%;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
      order: var(--mobile-order, 99);
    }
    .rls__item--hide-mobile {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
